  "releaseNotes": "RemoteMarketDataDrive. Logs property.\nIMessageAdapter. GenerateOrderBookFromLevel1 removed\nLookupSecuritiesResult translates found securities only.\nFormulaEditorAttribute moved to Ecng.\nUse Subscribe method directly.\nIBinaryAdapter\nGetCurrentPrice extension made obsolete.\nDerivativesHelper. Pass asset price directly.\nStrategyParam. Validators simplified.\nMarketEmulator. Prevent infinite loops.\nOrderFail. TransactionId property.\nQuotingStrategy replaced by QuotingProcessor.\nITimeProvider\nIConnector. Moved session state members into IMarketDataProvider and made them obsolete.\nTimeFrameLookupMessage -> DataTypeLookupMessage\nMarket rules for global subscriptions.\nStorageCoreSettings. Removed DaysLoad property.\nConnector. Removed Restored event.\nConnector. Removed TradesKeepCount, ReConnectionSettings, Orders, StopOrders, OrderRegisterFails, OrderCancelFails, Trades, MyTrades, News properties. Connector. Remove ReRegisterOrderPair method.\nISubscriptionProvider. Global subscriptions.\nDerivatives strategies moved to Samples.\nChild strategies no more longer supported.\nConnector. Removed obsolete RegisterXXX, UnRegisterXXX methods.\nStrategy. NewOrder event reverted.\nITransactionProvider, IMarketDataProvider. Marked as obsolete events.\nITransactionProvider. NewOrder, OrderChanged, NewMyTrade reverted and marked as obsolete.\nITransactionProvider, IMarketDataProvider, ISubscriptionProvider, IConnector. Removed obsolete events.\nProtectiveStrategy removed.\nCandleSeries made obsolete.\nDataType is optimizable value.\nStrategy. High level indicators bind supported complex indicators value split.",
